2. **代码逻辑定位**：日志显示 `runtime process exiting` 且伴随 HTTP 请求 `/work`（证据 #4）。\n3. **追踪链路闭合**：对应 `/work` 路径的 Trace Span 明确记录了 `aiops.observed_mode: \"runtime_exit\"`（证据 #5）。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实**：虽然可确认是“运行时崩溃导致退出”，但缺乏具体导致崩溃的堆栈跟踪（Stack Trace）或详细错误文本（需通过代码审查获取），无法进一步定位具体的代码异常行或异常类型。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 108.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 108.0s (Evidence 100.4s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 141.83, "metrics": {"run_id": "595143ba3b444a65", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 141.8442726135254, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confi